     <narrative xml:lang="EN">OUTPUT 1.1 Number of alliances established or strengthened among local civil society across thematic areas and other relevant stakeholders to conduct advocacy with broader reach and impact, strategise on joint efforts, exchange expertise and build peer-to-peer support networks.
